# AICL Example: Max Subarray
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Kadane

Layer:
Core

Behavior MaxSub
    Input: array
    Output: max_sum
    Action:
        max_sum = array[0]
        curr_sum = array[0]
        for i in range(1, len(array)):
            if curr_sum + array[i] > array[i]:
                curr_sum = curr_sum + array[i]
            else:
                curr_sum = array[i]
            if curr_sum > max_sum:
                max_sum = curr_sum
        return max_sum
